  "rule": "genesis(K) = SHA-256(P(\"seam.audit.chain-genesis.v2\") || P([kind]) || P(stream_id) || P(tenant) || P(flow_id) || P(env) || V), P(x) = u32le(len(x)) || x; every part framed, an empty part is P(\"\") = 00000000; V = P(\"\") for version 0 (cell, tenant, live), P(u32le(version)) for a sandbox version >= 1. Refusals: a version on a cell/tenant key is cell_key_not_empty/tenant_key_has_flow, on a live key live_key_has_version; version 0 (= absent) on a sandbox key is sandbox_version_missing",
  "spec": "seam-runtime docs/specs/seam-event.v1.md §Chain key and genesis"
